raft a Task?  No: a row of its Job.", "originalText": "Is an email, a meeting or a draft a Task?  No: a row of its Job.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-923610797e45", "type": "text", "x": 1450.0, "y": 857.5, "width": 866.25, "height": 21.875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-dc7b69203e07", "roundness": null, "seed": 757254673, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 911376775, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· an email or a meeting is one file; a Task is a folder with its face, runs/ and delivery/", "originalText": "· an email or a meeting is one file; a Task is a folder with its face, runs/ and delivery/", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-fe37381f3fb8", "type": "text", "x": 1450.0, "y": 890.0, "width": 952.8750000000001, "height": 21.875, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-dc7b69203e07", "roundness": null, "seed": 649696858, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1449167290, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· its work is a soft Run of the Job: run-email-<thread> writes emails/<thread>.md, a pass per round", "originalText": "· its work is a soft Run of the Job: run-email-<thread> writes emails/<thread>.md, a pass per round", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-6b9f1555e19e", "type"